# Keep the working copy LF everywhere: zig fmt writes LF, and the tree was authored on
# Linux. Without this, Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true flip every file to CRLF
# and `zig fmt` then reports the whole tree as rewritten.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.zig text eol=lf
*.zon text eol=lf
*.wgsl text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
tools/zig text eol=lf

# Binaries
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf text
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
